# The clay map web bundle. ~105MB, rebuilt on every web change, and it was
# tracked through Git LFS — 135 committed versions, each a FULL copy because
# LFS stores whole files rather than deltas. That is what exhausted the LFS
# budget and blocked pushing this repo entirely.
#
# It is a BUILD ARTIFACT, not source: poplur-clay-map/scripts/sync-mobile.sh
# produces it (and writes it here) from the web repo, the same run that
# publishes iOS and Android. Its identity is recorded in bundle.json, so a
# build can tell whether the copy on disk is the one it expects.
#
# NOT published to the asset bucket on purpose: that bucket is world-readable
# (allUsers/objectViewer) and the built JS inlines the VITE_ keys, so serving
# this zip from it would put a Mapbox token and an ElevenLabs sk_ key behind a
# plain URL.
src/assets/claymap/claymap.zip
